rix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$4\\mathbf{a}-(3\\mathbf{b}-2\\mathbf{c})=\\hspace{0.167em}\\hspace{0.167em}=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "To compute the result, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\mathbf{a}-(3\\mathbf{b}-2\\mathbf{c}) & =4\\hspace{-0.167em}\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}-\\left(3\\hspace{-0.167em}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}-2\\hspace{-0.167em}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}\\right) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-20 \\\\ 12\\end{bmatrix}-\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 12\\end{bmatrix}\\right) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-20 \\\\ 12\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ -24\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-28 \\\\ 36\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186637626 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3106781c-8fdb-5fc3-a6b5-6e192295648d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}12 \\\\ -8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186637629} {:answer/id #uuid "94469b66-a12d-549a-a1a2-dbf3b2d84ef0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}39 \\\\ -20\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186637639} {:answer/id #uuid "c865366e-df80-5a74-a7b7-7f53686c489e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 28\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186637643} {:answer/id #uuid "e7ebe6f1-2a9f-501b-af22-5eea04abaccc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}37 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186637649} {:answer/id #uuid "f0c4c0b4-182c-5fc7-9178-8bdcacd6621f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 4\\